msgid "None"
msgstr "Nta na kimwe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere rusange"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service Check Name"
msgstr "Izina ry'igenzura rya serivisi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The name that is displayed for this Service Check, and is included in any Alert notifications."
msgstr "Izina ryerekanwa kuri iri Genzura rya Serivisi, kandi rishyirwa mu mamenyesha yose y'Impuruza."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many attempts"
msgstr "Umubare w'ingerageza"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Cacti attempts to run each test multiple times. The first successful attempt ends the testing and records the success. If none of the attempts are successful, the test is terminated and a failure is recorded. High number causes log test duration."
msgstr "Cacti igerageza gukora buri suzuma inshuro nyinshi. Igerageza rya mbere rigeze ku ntego rirangiza isuzuma rikandika ko byagenze neza. Niba nta gerageza na rimwe rigeze ku ntego, isuzuma rirahagarikwa kandi hakandikwa ko byanze. Umubare munini utera igihe kirekire cy'isuzuma."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable test"
msgstr "Fungura isuzuma"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disable this test from being checked."
msgstr "Kura akamenyetso muri aka gasanduku kugira ngo uhagarike isuzumwa ry'iki gipimo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable run script for this test"
msgstr "Fungura gukoresha script kuri iri suzuma"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the global Command Execution function is enabled, you can set here whether the script should be run for this test or not."
msgstr "Niba igikorwa rusange cyo Gukoresha Amategeko cyafunguwe, ushobora gushyiraho hano niba script igomba gukoreshwa kuri iri gerageza cyangwa itagomba gukoreshwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "Ikusanyamakuru"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller on which the test will run"
msgstr "Ikusanyamakuru isuzuma rizakorerwaho"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Type of service"
msgstr "Ubwoko bwa serivisi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "What type of service?"
msgstr "Ni ubuhe bwoko bwa serivisi?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "IP Address or DNS name of server"
msgstr "Aderesi ya IP cyangwa izina rya DNS rya seriveri"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "You can specify another port (example.com:5000) otherwise default will be used. For IPv6 numeric address use [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use here name of server (example 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"
msgstr "Ushobora kugaragaza indi port (example.com:5000) bitabaye ibyo hakazajya hakoreshwa isanzwe. Kuri aderesi y'imibare ya IPv6 koresha [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. Kuri DOH (DNS over HTTPS) koresha hano izina rya seriveri (urugero 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Resolve DNS to Address"
msgstr "Hindura DNS muri Aderesi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enter an IP Address to force DNS name to resolve to. Leaving blank will use DNS Resolution instead."
msgstr "Andika aderesi ya IP kugira ngo uhatire izina rya DNS kuyerekezaho. Gusiga harimo ubusa bizakoresha ishakisha rya DNS aho kubikora."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service settings"
msgstr "Amagenamiterere ya serivisi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Select correct credential"
msgstr "Hitamo icyangombwa cyo kwinjira gikwiye"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP OID"
msgstr "SNMP OID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SNMP OID"
msgstr "Shyiramo SNMP OID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH command"
msgstr "Itegeko rya SSH"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SSH command with full path, result of command will be returned"
msgstr "Shyiramo itegeko rya SSH hamwe n'inzira yuzuye, igisubizo cy'itegeko kizagarurwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your own CA and intermediate certs"
msgstr "Impamyabushobozi zawe bwite za CA n'izo hagati"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP Search"
msgstr "Ishakisha rya LDAP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search filter, it could be ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"
msgstr "Akayunguruzo k'ishakisha rya LDAP, gashobora kuba ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS Name for Query"
msgstr "Izina rya DNS ry'ibaza"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS name for querying. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use /resolve?name=example.com or /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. For plaintext DNS A and AAAA records will be returned"
msgstr "Izina rya DNS ryo kubaza. Kuri DOH (DNS kuri HTTPS) koresha /resolve?name=example.com cyangwa /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. Kuri DNS y'inyandiko isanzwe hazasubizwa inyandiko za A na AAAA"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Path Part of URL"
msgstr "Igice cy'inzira cya URL"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For web service insert at least \"/\" or something like \"/any/path/\"."
msgstr "Kuri serivisi y'urubuga shyiramo byibuze \"/\" cyangwa ikintu nka \"/inzira/yose/\"."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requires Authentication"
msgstr "Bisaba kwemeza umwirondoro"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box if the site will normally return a 401 Error as it requires a username and password."
msgstr "Hitamo aka gasanduku niba Ahantu ubusanzwe hazana ikosa rya 401 kuko hasaba izina ry'ukoresha n'ijambobanga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Seriveri y'umuhuza"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If this connection text requires a proxy, select it here.  Otherwise choose 'None'."
msgstr "Niba iyi nyandiko yo kwihuza isaba proxy, yihitemo hano. Bitabaye ibyo hitamo 'Nta na kimwe'."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check Certificate"
msgstr "Genzura icyemezo cy'umutekano"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to validate the certificate. Default on, turn off if you the site uses a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "Niba ukoresha SSL, shyira akamenyetso muri aka gasanduku niba ushaka kwemeza icyemezo. Mu buryo busanzwe birafunguye, bihagarike niba urubuga rukoresha icyemezo cyishyiriweho umukono."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check and notify Certificate expiration"
msgstr "Genzura kandi umeneshe igihe icyemezo cy'umutekano kirangiriye"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to check the certificate expiration. You can set in settings how many days before expiration notify.."
msgstr "Niba ukoresha SSL, shyira akamenyetso muri aka gasanduku niba ushaka kugenzura irangira ry'icyemezo. Ushobora gushyira mu magenamiterere umubare w'iminsi mbere y'uko rirangira ngo umenyeshwe.."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Ibipimo ngenderwaho"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How Often to Test"
msgstr "Inshuro zo Kugenzura"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Test every xth poller run"
msgstr "Gerageza kuri buri nshuro ya x y'ikusanyamakuru"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "Imbarutso"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the service must be DOWN before an alert email is triggered."
msgstr "Ni inshuro zingahe serivisi igomba kuba YAHAGAZE mbere y'uko imeyili y'impuruza yoherezwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Long duration alert"
msgstr "Impuruza y'igihe kirekire"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the test time is greater than this value more times in a row, send a notification. Related to variable Duration count. The test inherits the maximum runtime from the settings. If a higher value is set here, the maximum runtime is this value + 2 seconds."
msgstr "Niba igihe cy'igerageza kiruta aka gaciro inshuro nyinshi zikurikirana, ohereza imenyesha. Bifitanye isano n'igihindagurika cy'umubare w'Igihe. Igerageza rifata igihe ntarengwa cyo gukora kivuye mu magenamiterere. Niba hashyizweho agaciro karuta hano, igihe ntarengwa cyo gukora ni aka gaciro + amasegonda 2."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Number of duration violations in a row"
msgstr "Umubare w'inshuro zikurikirana zarengeje igihe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the duration trigger must be exceeded in a row for a notification to be sent"
msgstr "Ni inshuro zingahe igipimo cy'igihe kigomba kurengwa zikurikiranya kugira ngo imenyesha ryoherezwe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verification Strings"
msgstr "Imirongo y'inyuguti yo kugenzura"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String"
msgstr "Ijambo rishakishwa mu gisubizo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for in the response for a live and working service."
msgstr "Iyi ni inyandiko yo gushakisha mu gisubizo kuri serivisi iriho kandi ikora."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Maintenance"
msgstr "Ijambo rishakishwa mu gisubizo - Imirimo y'isana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for on the Maintenance .  The Service Check will check for this string if the above string is not found.  If found, it means that the service is under maintenance."
