#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "<b>Can be used for a lot of service checks:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - optional, when it is set, try HTTP basic auth<br/><i>SMTP on port 587</i> - optional. Without a username/password, only the server response is tested. With a username and password, login is also performed<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - optional. For anonymous ftp, use username \"anonymous\" and email address as password<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - required<br/><i>MQTT</i> - optional<br/><i>SCP, SSH command</i> - you can use this method or private key method"
msgstr "<b>Ishobora gukoreshwa mu igenzura ry'imikorere myinshi ya serivisi:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - si itegeko, iyo yashyizweho, gerageza kwemeza kw'ibanze kwa HTTP<br/><i>SMTP kuri port 587</i> - si itegeko. Iyo nta zina ry'ukoresha/ijambobanga bihari, hagenzurwa gusa igisubizo cya seriveri. Iyo hari izina ry'ukoresha n'ijambobanga, kwinjira na byo birakorwa<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - si itegeko. Kuri ftp itazwi nyirayo, koresha izina ry'ukoresha \"anonymous\" na aderesi y'imeyili nk'ijambobanga<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - birakenewe<br/><i>MQTT</i> - si itegeko<br/><i>SCP, itegeko rya SSH</i> - ushobora gukoresha ubu buryo cyangwa uburyo bw'urufunguzo bwite"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Basic HTTP auth. Username and password are required"
msgstr "Rest API - Kwemeza kwa HTTP gusanzwe. Izina ry'ukoresha n'ijambobanga birakenewe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - API key auth<br/>Auth is sent in HTTP header, custom header or POST method. Credentials in URL are not supported.<br/>Insert API key name and value. Both values are required. For HTTP header the name <i>Bearer or apikey or \"\"</i> is usually used (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). For custom header <i>X-API-Key</i> is usually used (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). For POST <i>api_key</i> is usually used."
msgstr "Rest API - Kwemeza ukoresheje urufunguzo rwa API<br/>Kwemeza koherezwa mu mutwe wa HTTP, umutwe wihariye cyangwa uburyo bwa POST. Ibiranga umwirondoro muri URL ntibyemewe.<br/>Shyiramo izina ry'urufunguzo rwa API n'agaciro karyo. Byombi birakenewe. Ku mutwe wa HTTP izina <i>Bearer cyangwa apikey cyangwa \"\"</i> rikunze gukoreshwa (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). Ku mutwe wihariye <i>X-API-Key</i> ikunze gukoreshwa (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). Kuri POST <i>api_key</i> ikunze gukoreshwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - OAuth2/Bearer token auth<br/>You can have key/token from server and insert it here or use auth flow with credentials. Username and password are sent Json encoded."
msgstr "Rest API - Kwemeza ukoresheje ikimenyetso cya OAuth2/Bearer<br/>Ushobora kugira urufunguzo/ikimenyetso kivuye kuri seriveri ukacyinjiza hano cyangwa ugakoresha inzira yo kwemeza hamwe n'ibyangombwa by'umwirondoro. Izina ry'ukoresha n'ijambobanga byoherezwa byahinduwe mu buryo bwa Json."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Cookie based auth - both values are required. After login, cookie is returned"
msgstr "Rest API - Kwemeza gushingiye kuri Cookie - indangagaciro zombi zirakenewe. Nyuma yo kwinjira, cookie iragarurwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v1 or v2 - required, insert community name here"
msgstr "SNMP v1 cyangwa v2 - birakenewe, shyiramo izina ry'umuryango hano"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v3 - The security level determines which parameters are required"
msgstr "SNMP v3 - Urwego rw'umutekano rugena ibisabwa bikenewe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH private key - Can be used for SCP or SSH command test. These test can use username/password too"
msgstr "Urufunguzo bwite rwa SSH - Rushobora gukoreshwa mu igerageza rya SCP cyangwa ry'itegeko rya SSH. Iri gerageza rishobora kandi gukoresha izina ry'ukoresha/ijambobanga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the web server is responding. If username/password credential is used, it will try Basic HTTP auth."
msgstr "Igenzura gusa niba seriveri y'urubuga isubiza. Niba hakoreshejwe izina ry'ukoresha/ijambobanga, izagerageza kwemeza umwirondoro kwa Basic HTTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as HTTP plaintext but adds the ability to test certificates."
msgstr "Ni kimwe na HTTP itabitswe mu ibanga ariko bikongeraho ubushobozi bwo kugerageza impamyabushobozi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the SMTP server is responding. No authentication. You will see server login banner and ehlo response."
msgstr "Igenzura gusa niba seriveri ya SMTP isubiza. Nta kwemeza umwirondoro. Uzabona itangazo ryo kwinjira rya seriveri n'igisubizo cya ehlo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted + STARTTLS. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. Without username and password, you will see server login banner and ehlo response. With credential, login will be performed"
msgstr "Idafite umutekano w'ibanga + STARTTLS. Birashoboka kandi gusuzuma ko icyemezo kigifite agaciro. Nta zina ry'ukoresha n'ijambobanga, uzabona ubutumwa bwo kwinjira bwa seriveri n'igisubizo cya ehlo. Ukoresheje ibyangombwa byo kwinjira, kwinjira bizakorwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted connection on default port 465. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. With username and password AUTH LOGIN will be tested."
msgstr "Umuhuza ushyizwe mu ibanga ku muryango usanzwe wa 465. Birashoboka kandi gusuzuma ko impamyabushobozi y'umutekano igifite agaciro. Hamwe n'izina ry'ukoresha n'ijambobanga, AUTH LOGIN izasuzumwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted IMAP connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages. You can use AUTHENTICATE PLAIN or AUTHENTICATE LOGIN method."
msgstr "Umuhuzanzira wa IMAP udafite umutekano w'ibanga. Nta byangombwa byo kwinjira, umuhuzanzira gusa ni wo uzasuzumwa. Uzabona gusa ubutumwa bwo kwinjira. Ukoresheje ibyangombwa byo kwinjira, kwinjira bizasuzumwa kandi bigerageze gusoma urutonde rw'ubutumwa. Ushobora gukoresha uburyo bwa AUTHENTICATE PLAIN cyangwa AUTHENTICATE LOGIN."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted IMAP but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Ni kimwe na IMAP idasobanuye mu ibanga ariko nyuma yo kwinjira hakoreshwa STARTTLS. Birashoboka kandi kugerageza ukuri kw'impamyabushobozi nyuma ya STARTTLS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted IMAP, you can try login and test certificate and user login"
msgstr "IMAP yashyizwe mu ibanga, ushobora kugerageza kwinjira no gusuzuma impamyabushobozi y'umutekano n'iyinjira ry'ukoresha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted POP3 connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages"
msgstr "Umuhuzanzira wa POP3 udafite umutekano w'ibanga. Nta byangombwa byo kwinjira, umuhuzanzira gusa ni wo uzasuzumwa. Uzabona gusa ubutumwa bwo kwinjira. Ukoresheje ibyangombwa byo kwinjira, kwinjira bizasuzumwa kandi bigerageze gusoma urutonde rw'ubutumwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted POP3 but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Ni kimwe na POP3 idasobanuye mu ibanga ariko nyuma yo kwinjira hakoreshwa STARTTLS. Birashoboka kandi kugerageza ukuri kw'impamyabushobozi nyuma ya STARTTLS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted POP3, you can try login and test certificate and user login."
msgstr "POP3 yashyizwe mu ibanga, ushobora kugerageza kwinjira no gusuzuma impamyabushobozi y'umutekano n'iyinjira ry'ukoresha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to resolve DNS record on specified DNS server"
msgstr "Gerageza gushakisha amakuru ya DNS kuri seriveri ya DNS yatanzwe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try DNS over HTTPS."
msgstr "Gerageza DNS ukoresheje HTTPS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform unencrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Ibipimo byose birakenewe. Kora kwinjira kutabitswe mu ibanga no gushakisha muri LDAP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform encrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Ibipimo byose birakenewe. Kora kwinjira gushyinguye mu ibanga no gushakisha muri LDAP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted FTP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt). For anonymous connection use login *anonymous* and email address as password. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Umuhuzanzira wa FTP udafite umutekano w'ibanga, injira maze ugerageze gukurura dosiye yerekanywe mu nzira (/path/to/file.txt). Ku muhuzanzira utazwi koresha izina ryo kwinjira *anonymous* na aderesi ya imeyili nk'ijambobanga. Ibirimo muri dosiye birasubizwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt) from TFTP server. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Gerageza gukuramo dosiye yatanzwe mu nzira (/path/to/file.txt) kuri seriveri ya TFTP. Ibikubiye muri iyo dosiye biragarurwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted SCP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt)."
msgstr "Umuhuza wa SCP ushyizwe mu ibanga, injira kandi ugerageze gukurura dosiye yatanzwe mu nzira (/path/to/file.txt)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SMB protocol, username and password are required. Try to login and download file."
msgstr "Gerageza porotokole ya SMB, izina ry'ukoresha n'ijambobanga birakenewe. Gerageza kwinjira no gukuramo dosiye."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connect to MQTT server and listen for any message. You can specify topic in Path (bedroom/temp), blank for any topic. For this test is recommended increase \"Long duration alert\""
msgstr "Huza na seriveri ya MQTT hanyuma utege amatwi ubutumwa ubwo ari bwo bwose. Ushobora kugaragaza ingingo muri Inzira (bedroom/temp), cyangwa ugasiga harimo ubusa ku ngingo iyo ari yo yose. Kuri iri suzuma birasabwa kongera \"Iburira ry'igihe kirekire\""

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with basic HTTP auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Igerageza rya REST API hakoreshejwe kwemeza kw'ibanze kwa HTTP. Banza utegure ibyangombwa byo kwinjira."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with API key auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Igerageza rya REST API hakoreshejwe kwemeza kwa urufunguzo rwa API. Banza utegure ibyangombwa byo kwinjira."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with Oauth2. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Igerageza rya REST API hakoreshejwe Oauth2. Banza utegure ibyangombwa byo kwinjira."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with cookie auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Igerageza rya REST API hakoreshejwe kwemeza kwa cookie. Banza utegure ibyangombwa byo kwinjira."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP get method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Gerageza uburyo bwa SNMP get. Ibisohoka kuri OID yatanzwe biragarurwa. Ibyangombwa byo kwinjira birakenewe, ugomba kubanza gutegura ibyangombwa bya SNMP v.1,2 cyangwa v3."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP walk method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Gerageza uburyo bwa SNMP walk. Ibisohoka kuri OID yatanzwe biragarurwa. Ibyangombwa byo kwinjira birakenewe, ugomba kubanza gutegura ibyangombwa bya SNMP v.1,2 cyangwa v3."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Use ssh and connect to remote host. After login run specified command and return output. Username and password or private key is possible."
msgstr "Koresha ssh maze wiyunge kuri mwakirizi iri kure. Nyuma yo kwinjira, koresha itegeko ryatanzwe maze ugarure ibisubizo. Izina ry'ukoresha n'ijambobanga cyangwa urufunguzo rw'ibanga birashoboka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SFTP protocol on port 22, username and password and path are required. Try to do directory listing of path."
msgstr "Porotokole ya SFTP ku cyambu 22, izina ry'ukoresha n'ijambobanga n'inzira birakenewe. Gerageza gukora urutonde rw'ububiko bw'inzira."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All fine. Proceed as usual."
msgstr "Byose bimeze neza. Komeza nk'uko bisanzwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL you passed to libcurl used a protocol that this libcurl does not support. The support might be a compile-time option that you did not use, it can be a misspelled protocol string or just a protocol libcurl has no code for."
msgstr "URL wahaye libcurl yakoresheje porotokole iyi libcurl idashyigikiye. Ubushobozi bushobora kuba ari ihitamo ryo mu gihe cyo gukoranya porogaramu utigeze ukoresha, bishobora kuba ari porotokole yanditse nabi cyangwa gusa porotokole libcurl itagirira kode."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Early initialization code failed. This is likely to be an internal error or problem, or a resource problem where something fundamental could not get done at init time."
msgstr "Kode yo gutangira kare yanze. Ibi bishobora kuba ari ikosa ry'imbere cyangwa ikibazo, cyangwa ikibazo cy'ibikoresho aho ikintu cy'ibanze kitashoboye gukorwa mu gihe cyo gutangira."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL was not properly formatted."
msgstr "URL ntiyari yanditse mu buryo bukwiye."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A requested feature, protocol or option was not found built-in in this libcurl due to a build-time decision. This means that a feature or option was not enabled or explicitly disabled when libcurl was built and in order to get it to function you have to get a rebuilt libcurl."
msgstr "Igikorwa, uburyo bw'itumanaho cyangwa ihitamo ryasabwe ntibyabonetse muri iyi libcurl bitewe n'icyemezo cyafashwe igihe yubakwaga. Ibi bisobanura ko igikorwa cyangwa ihitamo bitafunguwe cyangwa byahagaritswe ku bushake igihe libcurl yubakwaga kandi kugira ngo bikore ugomba kubona libcurl yongeye kubakwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve proxy. The given proxy host could not be resolved."
msgstr "Ntibyashobotse kubona proxy. Mwakirizi wa proxy watanzwe ntiyabonetse."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve host. The given remote host was not resolved."
msgstr "Ntibyashobotse kubona mwakirizi. Mwakirizi wa kure watanzwe ntiyabonetse."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to connect() to host or proxy."
msgstr "Kwihuza connect() na mwakirizi cyangwa proxy byanze."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server sent data libcurl could not parse. This error code was known as CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY before 7.51.0."
msgstr "Seriveri yohereje amakuru libcurl itashoboye gusesengura. Iyi kode y'ikosa yari izwi nka CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY mbere ya 7.51.0."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "We were denied access to the resource given in the URL. For FTP, this occurs while trying to change to the remote directory."
msgstr "Twimwe uburenganzira bwo kugera ku mutungo watanzwe muri URL. Kuri FTP, ibi bibaho iyo ugerageza guhindura ububiko bwa kure."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "While waiting for the server to connect back when an active FTP session is used, an error code was sent over the control connection or similar."
msgstr "Mu gihe hategerejwe ko seriveri yongera kwihuza iyo igikorwa gikora cya FTP gikoreshejwe, kode y'ikosa yoherejwe ku muyoboro w'igenzura cyangwa ibimeze nk'ibyo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "After having sent the FTP password to the server, libcurl expects a proper reply. This error code indicates that an unexpected code was returned."
msgstr "Nyuma yo kohereza ijambobanga rya FTP kuri seriveri, libcurl yiteze igisubizo gikwiye. Iyi kode y'ikosa igaragaza ko hagaruwe kode itari yitezwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "During an active FTP session while waiting for the server to connect, the CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (or the internal default) timeout expired."
msgstr "Mu gihe cy'ikiganiro cya FTP kirimo gukora hategerejwe ko seriveri yihuza, igihe ntarengwa cya CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (cyangwa icy'imbere fatizo) cyarangiye."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Libcurl failed to get a sensible result back from the server as a response to either a PASV or a EPSV command. The server is flawed."
msgstr "Libcurl yananiwe kubona igisubizo cyumvikana kivuye kuri seriveri nk'igisubizo ku itegeko rya PASV cyangwa rya EPSV. Seriveri ifite ikibazo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "FTP servers return a 227-line as a response to a PASV command. If libcurl fails to parse that line, this return code is passed back."
msgstr "Seriveri za FTP zisubiza umurongo wa 227 nk'igisubizo ku itegeko rya PASV. Iyo libcurl inanirwe gusesengura uwo murongo, iyi kode y'igisubizo irasubizwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal failure to lookup the host used for the new connection."
msgstr "Ikosa ry'imbere mu gushakisha mwakirizi wakoreshejwe ku ihuza rishya."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP2 framing layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "Ikibazo cyagaragaye mu cyiciro cyo kubaka amapaki ya HTTP2. Ibi ni rusange kandi bishobora kuba kimwe mu bibazo byinshi, reba mu bubiko bw'amakosa ku bisobanuro birambuye."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Received an error when trying to set the transfer mode to binary or ASCII."
msgstr "Habonetse ikosa mu gihe cyo gushyiraho uburyo bw'iyohereza kuri binary cyangwa ASCII."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file transfer was shorter or larger than expected. This happens when the server first reports an expected transfer size, and then delivers data that does not match the previously given size."
msgstr "Iyoherezwa ry'idosiye ryabaye rigufi cyangwa rinini kurusha uko byari byitezwe. Ibi bibaho iyo seriveri ibanje gutangaza ingano y'iyoherezwa yitezwe, hanyuma igatanga amakuru adahuye n'ingano yari yatanzwe mbere."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This was either a weird reply to a 'RETR' command or a zero byte transfer complete."
msgstr "Iki cyari igisubizo kidasanzwe ku itegeko rya 'RETR' cyangwa iyimura ryarangiye rifite bayiti zeru."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Obsolete Error"
msgstr "Ikosa ritagikoreshwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Not used in modern versions."
msgstr "Ntibikoreshwa muri verisiyo zigezweho."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When sending custom \"QUOTE\" commands to the remote server, one of the commands returned an error code that was 400 or higher (for FTP) or otherwise indicated unsuccessful completion of the command."
msgstr "Mu gihe hoherezwa amategeko yihariye ya \"QUOTE\" kuri seriveri ya kure, rimwe mu mategeko ryagaruye kode y'ikosa iri ku 400 cyangwa hejuru yayo (kuri FTP) cyangwa ryerekanye ko iryo tegeko ritarangiye neza."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is returned if CURLOPT_FAILONERROR is set true and the HTTP server returns an error code that is >= 400."
msgstr "Ibi bigarurwa niba CURLOPT_FAILONERROR yashyizwe kuri true kandi seriveri ya HTTP ikagarura kode y'ikosa iri >= 400."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An error occurred when writing received data to a local file, or an error was returned to libcurl from a write callback."
msgstr "Habaye ikosa mu gihe cyo kwandika amakuru yakiriwe muri dosiye y'imbere, cyangwa hasubijwe ikosa kuri libcurl rivuye muri callback yo kwandika."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed starting the upload. For FTP, the server typically denied the STOR command. The error buffer usually contains the server's explanation for this."
msgstr "Gutangira kohereza byanze. Kuri FTP, ubusanzwe seriveri yanze itegeko rya STOR. Ububiko bw'amakosa ubusanzwe buba burimo ibisobanuro bya seriveri kuri ibi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "There was a problem reading a local file or an error returned by the read callback."
msgstr "Habaye ikibazo mu gusoma dosiye y'imbere cyangwa ikosa ryagaruwe na callback yo gusoma."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A memory allocation request failed. This is serious badness and things are severely screwed up if this ever occurs."
msgstr "Ubusabe bwo gutanga umwanya mu bubiko bw'imashini bwanze. Iri ni ikosa rikomeye cyane kandi ibintu biba byangiritse bikabije iyo ibi bibayeho."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Operation timeout. The specified time-out period was reached according to the conditions."
msgstr "Igihe cy'igikorwa cyarangiye. Igihe ntarengwa cyagenwe cyagezweho ukurikije ibisabwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP PORT command returned error. This mostly happens when you have not specified a good enough address for libcurl to use. See CURLOPT_FTPPORT."
msgstr "Itegeko rya FTP PORT ryagaruye ikosa. Ibi akenshi biba iyo utatanze aderesi ihagije neza kuri libcurl ngo iyikoreshe. Reba CURLOPT_FTPPORT."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP REST command returned error. This should never happen if the server is sane."
msgstr "Itegeko rya FTP REST ryagaruye ikosa. Ibi ntibyakabaye biba niba seriveri ikora neza."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server does not support or accept range requests."
msgstr "Seriveri ntiyemera cyangwa ntiyakira ibyifuzo by'interuro y'ibice."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is an odd error that mainly occurs due to internal confusion."
msgstr "Iri ni ikosa ridasanzwe rikunze kubaho kubera ukwivanga kw'imbere."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem occurred somewhere in the SSL/TLS handshake. You really want the error buffer and read the message there as it pinpoints the problem slightly more. Could be certificates (file formats, paths, permissions), passwords, and others."
msgstr "Ikibazo cyabereye ahantu runaka mu guhana amakuru kw'ibanze kwa SSL/TLS. Ugomba kureba mu bubiko bw'amakosa ugasoma ubutumwa burimo kuko bugaragaza neza kurushaho aho ikibazo kiri. Bishobora kuba ibyemezo (ubwoko bw'amadosiye, inzira, uburenganzira), amagambobanga, n'ibindi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The download could not be resumed because the specified offset was out of the file boundary."
msgstr "Gukurura dosiye ntibyashoboye gukomeza kuko aho byatangiriye hagenwe harenze imbibi za dosiye."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file given with FILE:// could not be opened. Most likely because the file path does not identify an existing file. Did you check file permissions?"
msgstr "Idosiye yatanzwe na FILE:// ntiyashoboye gufungurwa. Birashoboka cyane ko inzira y'idosiye itagaragaza idosiye iriho. Wigeze ugenzura uburenganzira bw'idosiye?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP cannot bind. LDAP bind operation failed."
msgstr "LDAP ntishobora kwihuza. Igikorwa cyo guhuza LDAP cyananiranye."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search failed."
msgstr "Ishakisha rya LDAP ryananiranye."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Function not found. A required zlib function was not found."
msgstr "Umumaro ntiwabonetse. Umumaro wa zlib ukenewe ntiwabonetse."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Aborted by callback. A callback returned \"abort\" to libcurl."
msgstr "Byahagaritswe na callback. Callback yasubije \"abort\" kuri libcurl."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A function was called with a bad parameter."
msgstr "Imikorere yahamagawe hakoreshejwe igipimo kitari cyo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Interface error. A specified outgoing interface could not be used. Set which interface to use for outgoing connections' source IP address with URLOPT_INTERFACE."
msgstr "Ikosa ry'impuza. Impuza isohoka yatanzwe ntiyashoboye gukoreshwa. Genamo impuza igomba gukoreshwa kuri aderesi ya IP y'inkomoko y'imiyoboro isohoka ukoresheje URLOPT_INTERFACE."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Too many redirects. When following redirects, libcurl hit the maximum amount. Set your limit with CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."
msgstr "Koherezwa ku zindi paji kwinshi cyane. Mu gukurikira aho byoherezwa, libcurl yageze ku rugero ntarengwa. Shyiraho urugero rwawe ukoresheje CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed to libcurl is not recognized/known. Refer to the appropriate documentation. This is most likely a problem in the program that uses libcurl. The error buffer might contain more specific information about which exact option it concerns."
msgstr "Ihitamo ryoherejwe kuri libcurl ntirizwi. Reba inyandiko zikwiye. Birashoboka ko ari ikibazo muri porogaramu ikoresha libcurl. Ububiko bw'ikosa bushobora kuba burimo amakuru arambuye ku ihitamo nyaryo bireba."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed in to a setopt was wrongly formatted. See error message for details about what option."
msgstr "Ihitamo ryoherejwe muri setopt ryari ryanditswe nabi. Reba ubutumwa bw'ikosa kugira ngo umenye ibisobanuro ku ihitamo iryo ari ryo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Nothing was returned from the server, and under the circumstances, getting nothing is considered an error."
msgstr "Nta kintu cyagarutse kivuye kuri seriveri, kandi muri ibi bihe, kutabona ikintu bifatwa nk'ikosa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The specified crypto engine was not found."
msgstr "Moteri y'ibanga yavuzwe ntiyabonetse."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed setting the selected SSL crypto engine as default."
msgstr "Gushyira moteri ya SSL crypto yahiswemo nk'isanzwe byanze."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed sending network data."
msgstr "Kohereza amakuru y'urusobe byanze."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failure with receiving network data."
msgstr "Ikibazo mu kwakira amakuru y'urusobe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "problem with the local client certificate."
msgstr "ikibazo ku cyemezo cy'umukiriya w'imbere."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not use specified cipher."
msgstr "Ntibyashobotse gukoresha uburyo bw'ibanga bwagenwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server's SSL certificate or SSH fingerprint was deemed not OK. This error code has been unified with CURLE_SSL_CACERT since 7.62.0. Its previous value was 51."
msgstr "Impamyabushobozi ya SSL ya seriveri ya kure cyangwa ikimenyetso cya SSH byasanzwe bitameze neza. Iyi kode y'ikosa yahujwe na CURLE_SSL_CACERT guhera kuri 7.62.0. Agaciro kayo ka mbere kari 51."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unrecognized transfer encoding."
msgstr "Imisobekere y'iyohereza itamenyekanye."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum file size exceeded."
msgstr "Ingano ntarengwa ya dosiye yarenzwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requested FTP SSL level failed."
msgstr "Urwego rwa FTP SSL rwasabwe rwananiwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When doing a send operation curl had to rewind the data to retransmit, but the rewinding operation failed."
msgstr "Mu gihe cyo kohereza amakuru, curl yagombaga gusubiza amakuru inyuma ngo yongere iyohereze, ariko igikorwa cyo kuyasubiza inyuma cyananiranye."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Initiating the SSL Engine failed."
msgstr "Gutangiza moteri ya SSL byanze."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server denied curl to login (Added in 7.13.1)"
msgstr "Seriveri ya kure yangiye curl kwinjira (Byongeweho muri 7.13.1)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File not found on TFTP server."
msgstr "Dosiye ntiyabonetse kuri seriveri ya TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Permission problem on TFTP server."
msgstr "Ikibazo cy'uruhushya kuri seriveri ya TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Out of disk space on the server."
msgstr "Umwanya wo kuri disiki ya seriveri washize."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Illegal TFTP operation."
msgstr "Igikorwa cya TFTP kitemewe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unknown TFTP transfer ID."
msgstr "Indangamubare y'iyohereza rya TFTP itazwi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File already exists and is not overwritten."
msgstr "Dosiye isanzwe ihari kandi ntiyasimbuwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This error should never be returned by a properly functioning TFTP server."
msgstr "Iri kosa ntirikwiye na rimwe kugarurwa na seriveri ya TFTP ikora neza."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Problem with reading the SSL CA cert (path? access rights?)"
msgstr "Ikibazo mu gusoma impamyabushobozi ya SSL CA (inzira? uburenganzira bwo kwinjira?)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The resource referenced in the URL does not exist."
msgstr "Umutungo werekejweho muri URL ntubaho."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An unspecified error occurred during the SSH session."
msgstr "Habaye ikosa ritasobanuwe mu gihe cy'umukoro wa SSH."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to shut down the SSL connection."
msgstr "Gufunga ihuzanzira rya SSL byanze."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Socket is not ready for send/recv wait till it's ready and try again. This return code is only returned from curl_easy_recv and curl_easy_send (Added in 7.18.2)"
msgstr "Socket ntiyiteguye kohereza/kwakira, tegereza yitegure maze wongere ugerageze. Iyi kode yo gusubiza itangwa gusa na curl_easy_recv na curl_easy_send (Yongeweho muri 7.18.2)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to load CRL file (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Gupakira dosiye ya CRL byanze (Byongewe muri 7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Issuer check failed (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Igenzura ry'uwatanze icyemezo ryananiwe (Byongewe muri 7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP server does not understand the PRET command at all or does not support the given argument. Be careful when using CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, a custom LIST command is sent with the PRET command before PASV as well. (Added in 7.20.0)"
msgstr "Seriveri ya FTP ntiyumva na gato itegeko rya PRET cyangwa ntishyigikira impamvu yatanzwe. Itondere igihe ukoresha CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, itegeko ryihariye rya LIST ryoherezwa hamwe n'itegeko rya PRET mbere ya PASV na ryo. (Byongeweho muri 7.20.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP CSeq numbers."
msgstr "Kutajyana kw'imibare ya RTSP CSeq."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP Session Identifiers."
msgstr "Kutajyana kw'ibirango by'icyiciro cya RTSP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unable to parse FTP file list (during FTP wildcard downloading)."
msgstr "Ntibishoboka gusesengura urutonde rw'amadosiye ya FTP (mu gihe cyo gukurura hakoreshejwe utumenyetso tw'inyandiko kuri FTP)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Chunk callback reported error."
msgstr "Isubizanyuma ry'igice ryagaragaje ikosa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "(For internal use only, is never returned by libcurl) No connection available, the session is queued. (added in 7.30.0)"
msgstr "(Bikoreshwa imbere gusa, ntibitangwa na libcurl) Nta murongo uhari, igikorwa gishyizwe ku murongo wo gutegereza. (byongeweho muri 7.30.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to match the pinned key specified with CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."
msgstr "Guhuza urufunguzo rwometseho rwatanzwe na CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY byanze."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Status returned failure when asked with CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."
msgstr "Imiterere yagaragaje ko byanze ubwo yabazwaga na CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stream error in the HTTP/2 framing layer."
msgstr "Ikosa ry'umuyoboro w'amakuru mu rwego rwa HTTP/2."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An API function was called from inside a callback."
msgstr "Umukoro wa API wahamagawe imbere muri callback."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An authentication function returned an error."
msgstr "Umukoro wo kwemeza umwirondoro wasubije ikosa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP/3 layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "Ikibazo cyagaragaye mu cyiciro cya HTTP/3. Ibi ni rusange kandi bishobora kuba kimwe mu bibazo byinshi, reba mu bubiko bw'amakosa ku bisobanuro birambuye."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "QUIC connection error. This error may be caused by an SSL library error. QUIC is the protocol used for HTTP/3 transfers."
msgstr "Ikosa ryo guhuza na QUIC. Iri kosa rishobora guterwa n'ikosa rya libureri ya SSL. QUIC ni porotokole ikoreshwa mu kohereza amakuru ya HTTP/3."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy handshake error. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR provides extra details on the specific problem."
msgstr "Ikosa mu guhuza na Proxy. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR itanga ibisobanuro byisumbuyeho ku kibazo nyirizina."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSL Client Certificate required."
msgstr "Icyemezo cy'umukiriya wa SSL kirakenewe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal call to poll() or select() returned error that is not recoverable."
msgstr "Ihamagara ry'imbere rya poll() cyangwa select() ryasubije ikosa ridashobora gukosorwa."

